    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE AGE OF THE SEERS HAS BEGUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Thraebyn Tarbeard, a young dwarf and the first Seer, who is abducted by the vile Oluzhias and forced to do the necromancer's bidding. Along the path to becoming a dwarven warpriest, you learn to summon minions to aid you in fast-paced, bloody, arcade-like combat against the fierce creatures and monsters that inhabit the brutal, untamed swampland. Play as the villain as you harvest pneuma, the soul energy of living beings. Slaughter all in your path, and use the pneuma of your victims to replenish your own health, cast powerful spells, and turn feral enemies into ferocious allies. Will you help the necromancer take over Yvermist? Or will a worthier champion, a mighty Seer perhaps, be the one to finally unite all of the Exiles of Dhra? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMON YOUR MINIONS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FINISH YOUR ENEMIES AND HARVEST THEIR PNEUMA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN CREATURES INTO ALLIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAST PNEUMA SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey across Yvermist will not be easy. Wild beasts and giant monsters lurk around every corner. Fight alongside your minions and claw your way through the swamp, down the dark hollows, and through the trees of elven Yverwood. You will need to talk to the various peoples of Yvermist for valuable information, from the exiled Yverfolk tribes of elves, dwarves, orcs, and men, to the repulsive Crogghlodytes, a race of sanctimonious slavers who dominate the region. What else will you find as you pursue your dark destiny? Who will you meet in mystic places only a Seer can enter? Wonders and horrors alike await the Harbinger!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE AGE OF THE SEERS HAS BEGUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/ab7a1915f29312a548c61b85861853e4.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Thraebyn Tarbeard, a young dwarf and the first Seer, who is abducted by the vile Oluzhias and forced to do the necromancer's bidding. Along the path to becoming a dwarven warpriest, you learn to summon minions to aid you in fast-paced, bloody, arcade-like combat against the fierce creatures and monsters that inhabit the brutal, untamed swampland. Play as the villain as you harvest pneuma, the soul energy of living beings. Slaughter all in your path, and use the pneuma of your victims to replenish your own health, cast powerful spells, and turn feral enemies into ferocious allies. Will you help the necromancer take over Yvermist? Or will a worthier champion, a mighty Seer perhaps, be the one to finally unite all of the Exiles of Dhra? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMON YOUR MINIONS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/f37e829c4ff1d789971e8711175d1ec4.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FINISH YOUR ENEMIES AND HARVEST THEIR PNEUMA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/b724d467004b8935b4a37fbc87f6ee6b.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TURN CREATURES INTO ALLIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/d5d4f11ce642877b70c6c81ae1c51c74.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAST PNEUMA SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.poster.avif?t=1751914264\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.webm?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2702830/extras/3748e4888274d08adab57994576c09a3.mp4?t=1751914264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey across Yvermist will not be easy. Wild beasts and giant monsters lurk around every corner. Fight alongside your minions and claw your way through the swamp, down the dark hollows, and through the trees of elven Yverwood. You will need to talk to the various peoples of Yvermist for valuable information, from the exiled Yverfolk tribes of elves, dwarves, orcs, and men, to the repulsive Crogghlodytes, a race of sanctimonious slavers who dominate the region. What else will you find as you pursue your dark destiny? Who will you meet in mystic places only a Seer can enter? Wonders and horrors alike await the Harbinger!</p>",
    "short_description": "Seers of Ages Past 1: The Harbinger of Mah is an indie third-person open-world Action RPG where you play the origin story of the dwarven warpriest archvillain Tarbeard, the first Seer, who battles alongside his minions in the fast-paced arcade-like slaughter of the beasts and monsters of Yvermist.",
